      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A foe within reach attempts to move away from the Tiger Lord\n\nEffect The Tiger Lord Strides up to its Speed, following the foe and keeping it in reach throughout its movement until it stops moving or the Tiger Lord has moved its full Speed."
