    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Closing Volley",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The Tiger Lord makes a ranged Strike with a hatchet, then Strides up to twice its speed. If it ends its movement within melee reach of the target of its ranged Strike, it may make a melee Strike against that enemy. If the ranged Strike hit the target, the target is Off-Guard against the melee Strike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Vengeful Rage",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The Tiger Lord is not Fatigued or already in a rage\n\nTrigger The Tiger Lord suffers damage that reduces its Hit Points to 100 or less.\n\nEffect The Tiger Lord flies into a rage that lasts 1 minute. While raging, the Tiger Lord gains a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, gains a +2 status bonus to damage rolls, and takes a -2 status penalty to AC. After the rage, the Tiger Lord is fatigued.",
